        "Pattern>.",
        "Pattern> includes XML-reserved characters (\", &, ', <, or >), you must wrap it in a CDATA (character data) section, as shown in the sample above, or XML-encode the reserved characters: for example, by replacing < with &lt; and > with &gt;."
